#
# Userspace memory allocator built entirely on mmap/munmap syscalls.
# Provides alloc/dealloc/realloc/allocZeroed for arbitrary-size blocks.
# Each allocation prepends an 8-byte header storing the mapped region size
# so dealloc and realloc can retrieve it without external bookkeeping.
#
# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
# it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by
